<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Quicksand</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 31)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast quicksand
</pre>
<p>The caster folds their hands and chants 'Liquidus Sub Terra', and the 
ground of the whole room turns to a mire of quicksand. It is meant to slow 
everyone in the room but the caster, making them slower in a fight for a 
while, longer the better the casting.
</p><p>At present, because of a known bug, the quicksand only tells everyone that 
it hampers their movement: nobody is actually slowed.
</p><p>It can't be cast indoors, in the desert, on or under water, or on snow, 
slush or ice. You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
